 ## Format
 
-`.dualscan` version 1 is an original encrypted format: `DUALSCAN` + version byte, bounded JSON header, PBKDF2-SHA256 with 600,000 iterations and random 32-byte salt, then AES-256-GCM records with unique 12-byte nonces, 1 MiB plaintext chunks and a final authenticated zero-length record. The complete header, chunk number and length are authenticated on every record. The encrypted payload contains a length-prefixed JSON manifest followed by exact file bytes. There is no ZIP expansion, executable installer or cloud dependency.
